{
  "name": "Sephirotic Scion (Cherubic): The Gate Knows You",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "art/bbttcc/GOTTGAIT/BBTTCC%20Button%20Icons/BBTTCC_button_icon_dream_moon_gate.png",
  "system": {
    "category": "technique",
    "source": "Bad Eden Heritages v1.1 (RFI-native rules)",
    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-canon-sephirotic=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div><p><em>\"Everything is a door if you can read the seams.\"</em></p><p><strong>The Gate Knows You (1/Soma Break).</strong> Reaction — when a creature you can see within 6 squares attempts to open, close, lock, unlock, cross, or pass through a door, gate, threshold, ley-line gate, or named boundary, the target rolls 3d10 keep lowest 2 on any check or defense check related to that crossing. The boundary listens to you.</p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"sephCherubicGate\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\"><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #d4b8e8; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; font-size: 0.78rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>The Gate Knows You</strong></span> <span style=\"opacity: 0.92; line-height: 1.4; font-size: 0.86rem\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/Soma Break  ·  <strong>Action:</strong> Reaction (within 6 squares)  ·  <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</span> <span style=\"opacity: 0.85; margin-top: 0.3rem; font-size: 0.82rem\">Force a creature attempting to open/close/cross any door, gate, threshold, ley-line gate, or named boundary to roll 3d10 keep lowest 2 on the related check or defense.</span></p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
